# macOS dmg resources (BL-CATFISH-MAC-OFFLINE-INSTALL 7/15).
#
# 4 个真实 artifact 由 build-macos-resources.sh 在 build 前打包生成,
# 大小 ~250MB, 不进 git.
#
# 但**空 placeholder** (git 里 track, size=0) 必须留, 因为 tauri.conf.json
# bundle.resources 跨平台 validate source 存在.
#
# macOS build 流程:
#   1. bash src-tauri/scripts/build-macos-resources.sh
#      → 覆盖 4 个 placeholder 成真 250MB artifact
#   2. npm run tauri:build
#      → 出 dmg (~250MB)
#   3. git checkout resources/mac/{install.sh,uv,cpython-*.tar.gz,hermes-*.tar.gz}
#      → 恢复空 placeholder, working tree clean

*.log
